// Regla Sigma: proc_creation_win_powershell_console_history_file_access.yml
// ID Sigma: f4ff7323-b5fc-4323-8b52-6b9408e15788
// Título: Potential PowerShell Console History Access Attempt via History File
// Descripción: Detects potential access attempts to the PowerShell console history directly via history file (ConsoleHost_history.txt).
This can give access to plaintext passwords used in PowerShell commands or used for general reconnaissance.

// Aplica a: Producto: windows | Categoría: process_creation
// Producto: windows
// Categoría: process_creation
// Servicio: 
// Nivel: medium
// Pipeline: microsoft_xdr
// Ruta original: C:\SigmaLab\sigma\rules\windows\process_creation\proc_creation_win_powershell_console_history_file_access.yml
// Requiere validación en el entorno de destino.

DeviceProcessEvents
| where ProcessCommandLine contains "ConsoleHost_history.txt" or ProcessCommandLine contains "(Get-PSReadLineOption).HistorySavePath"
